# basePath SupplyIntro

:: StartBuilding
@trigger    OnSupplySetupCompleted
$set    temp:researchTutorialStep = 0
{@PAL}  Build a route to complete the contract. \n\nStart by selecting a ship.


:: FirstShipSelected
@trigger    OnShipSelected
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 0
$set    temp:researchTutorialStep = 1
{@PAL}  Hover over the planet with your mouse to see the time, cost, and risk level.


:: FirstPlanetHovered
@trigger    OnPlanetHovered
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 1
$if        planet == "Planet0"
    $set   temp:researchTutorialStep = 2
    {@PAL}  Click on the planet to select this route segment.
$else 
    // hovering over other planet
$endif


:: FirstNodeClicked
@trigger    OnNodeClicked
@when       node == "Planet0", temp:researchTutorialStep == 2
{@PAL}  Great. Now click the Fab (your main ship).


:: FirstRouteCompleted
@trigger    OnRouteCompleted
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 2
$set    temp:researchTutorialStep = 3
{@PAL}  Uh-oh, this material wasn't a conductor. \n\nCheck the wiki to identify the materials on the planets.


:: WikiClosed
@trigger    OnWikiClosed
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 3
{@PAL}  Select the ship again to correct the route.


:: OnSecondShipSelected
@trigger    OnShipSelected
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 3
// TODO: either current implementation isn't complete or instructions need to change
{@PAL}  Select the paths and the planet to delete the current route.


:: OnRouteFullyRemoved
@trigger    OnRouteFullyRemoved
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 3
{@PAL}  Draw your new path to the planet with the Conductor.


:: MaterialGathered
@trigger    OnNodeClicked
@when       IsMaterialCollected("copper"), node == "Home"
$set    temp:researchTutorialStep = 4
{@PAL}  Click on empty space or the Fab to finalize this route.


:: LevelComplete
@trigger    OnRouteCompleted
@when       temp:researchTutorialStep == 4
$set    temp:researchTutorialStep = 5
{@PAL}  click CONFIRM to commit your entire supply chain.

